{
 "page": "GoinQuackersRecompiled.html",
 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, a release's check of about 10 minutes, longer than a",
  "regular play because it visits every level: the regular plan's start to the world map, then each level of the game's",
  "table of levels (tools/shader_plan.json's sections) in turn by tools/survey.js's go(), as the game's own exits change",
  "level, with a shot of each 3 s in and a short walk and jump. A level the game doesn't play within 45 s is logged",
  "([survey] not playing) and the plan goes on, so one play shows every level that fails.",
  "The menu shot is 3 s into the menu on that clock too, which stands still while Firefox builds the shader list's boot",
  "section as the menu first draws, the game waiting: 3 s of the browser's time there can shoot that wait's black."
